From 5afd1e091d5a9dad905f776b0c7bd1faa81d0f80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: linux-a9 <linux-a9@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:53:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] nvme/apple-ans: add iOS warm handoff modes and a pre-root
 health gate

Preserve a SHST-certified enabled controller for handoff, or pair port teardown with complete DART/NVMMU reactivation. Retain the Round 7 PCIe/NVMe sequence as a selectable control. Read NSID 1 MBR/GPT and root data through the normal queue before publishing disks, record failures before teardown, and allow one alternate-mode recovery. Keep DMA blocked until stopped-controller translation setup completes.
---
 drivers/nvme/host/pci-apple-ans.c       |  51 +++-
 drivers/nvme/host/pci-internal.h        |   7 +-
 drivers/nvme/host/pci.c                 | 184 ++++++++++++-
 drivers/pci/controller/pcie-apple-h9p.c | 346 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 571 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

